          </div>
          <div class="honor-card-info">
            <span class="honor-year">2022</span>
            <p class="honor-meta">Qualification</p>
            <h3>Chongqing Technology-based Enterprise</h3>
            <p>Provincial technology enterprise recognition</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="honor-card">
          <div class="honor-card-image">
            <img src="{{ 'cert-kunbo-trademark.png' | asset_url }}" alt="KUNBO Trademark Registration Certificate" loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="honor-card-info">
            <span class="honor-year">2022</span>
            <p class="honor-meta">IP</p>
