          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="honor-card">
          <div class="honor-card-image">
            <img src="{{ 'cert-business-license.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Chongqing Kunbo Building Materials Co., Ltd." loading="lazy">
          </div>
          <div class="honor-card-info">
            <span class="honor-year">2022</span>
            <p class="honor-meta">License</p>
            <h3>Chongqing Kunbo Building Materials Co., Ltd.</h3>
            <p>Business license registration</p>
